  "description": "FSQL is a lightweight, chainable SQL builder for .NET applications targeting OleDB and Microsoft Access databases. It lets you construct parameterized queries in a readable, left-to-right style that mirrors standard SQL clause order. This is without string concatenation, without SQL injection risk, and with compile-time analyzer support.",
